==Galician==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|gl|roa-opt|esquina}} (attested in the Galician ''{{w|Cantigas de Santa Maria}}'' c. 1264) perhaps from {{der|gl|got|*𐍃𐌺𐌹𐌽𐌰}},<ref>{{R:es:DCECH}}</ref> from {{der|gl|gem-pro|*skinō|t=rim, plate}}. Cognate with {{cog|fr|échine|t=spine of an animal}} and {{cog|en|shin}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|gl|/esˈkina̝/}}

===Noun===
{{gl-noun|f}}

# [[corner]]
#* {{quote-book|gl|year=1432|editor=X. Ferro Couselo|title=A vida e a fala dos devanceiros|location=Vigo|publisher=Galaxia|page=89
|passage=''estando y Martín Peres de Trella fasendo hua parede á '''esquina''' da parede de hua sua casa''
|translation=Being there Martin Perez de Trella, who was building a wall next to the '''corner''' of the wall of a house that belongs to him}}
# [[edge]]

====Synonyms====
